<table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jul 11, 2004 :: Grats Schena on your snakey!</div><p>Of course I took no pictures, but I got to watch it happen at least! Grats Schena on your Snakey Epic of Broodness! I'll try to get a picture and add it here later. </p><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jul 4, 2004 :: Happy 4th of July</div><strong><em><font color="#ff0000" size="6"><u>Remember to get Drunk.</u></font></em></strong><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Kassandra</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jul 2, 2004 :: Dragons by the dozen</div><p>Kasserole led us into his favorite temple for a few hours, and we keeled some dragons for fun. Lotsa trophy loots, some I forgot about. But I remember the stuff that didn't rot from the big guys! Grats Poyndexter on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/reapers_ring.JPG">Reaper's Ring</a> and <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/dfpics/ringofthesky1.jpg">Ring of the Sky</a>! Grats Traver on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=5924">Boots of the Dread Dream</a>! Grats Skoriksis on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/belt_destroyer.JPG">Belt of the Destroyer</a>! Grats Bishup on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/belt_destroyer.JPG">Belt of the Destroyer</a>, <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/mask_of_the_sky.jpg">Mask of the Sky</a> and <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/dfpics/ringofthesky1.jpg">Ring of the Sky</a>! Grats Kassandra on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/WurmClawPauldrons.jpg">Wurm Claw Pauldrons</a>! Grats Tellie and Lumalie both on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/staff_of_the_silent_star.jpg">Staff of the Silent Star</a>! Tellie got a crit for 800 the other day with it! </p><p>Was fun going back there, thanks again Kasserole! </p><p>And, um.. more people have still made levels.. I still suck. I know Screamz is moving up there to 53 last check! There's more.. </p><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jul 1, 2004 :: More Zerker Goodness!</div><p>Hey.. I can edit this from work.. that's going to cut down on my excuses. :(</p><p>Grats Haitful on your zerker epic! I didn't get a picture cause I'm a bum! </p><p>Had some more levels made, which I will figure out and probably forget to add later. :)</p><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jun 28, 2004 :: Questing, of Epic Proportions!</div><p><strong>LoisLayne Reporting Live from Capspot, POK!</strong></p><p><strong></strong><font size="2"><br />Over the course of the last few days, Capulus has seen the completion of 3 new epic quests, with all the hard work and determination of each individual culminating in the combined efforts of many of the guild members.  Congrats To Valoura on your new click stick!  Congrats to Tebo on your new pulsing Dx9 dream axe!  And congrats Vahnel on your light sabers!</font></p><p><img alt="epic_valoura" src="http://benedict.isomedia.com/homes/ekremca/eqfiles/epic_valoura.jpg" align="baseline" /></p><p alt="epic_tebo" /><p><img alt="epic_tebo" src="http://benedict.isomedia.com/homes/ekremca/eqfiles/epic_tebo.jpg" align="baseline" /></p><p alt="epic_vahnel" /><p /><img alt="epic_vahnel" src="http://benedict.isomedia.com/homes/ekremca/eqfiles/epic_vahnel.jpg" align="baseline" /><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by LoisLayne</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jun 26, 2004 :: Slowly coming out of hibernation..</div><p>We're starting to wake up again, slowly! Today was a day of epic fights, scattered throughout the day. Vermin got his Broken Golem and Phinny staff, Tebo got his Enraged Imp and I think some other parts too, Poyndexter got his Queen blade and green scale, Valoura got her note from the King, Schena got her Prince head. </p><p>Recently had our favorite Yelisnack, and GJ is not allowed to try to run anywhere anymore on his own.. even if he printed out a map! Beryllin got his head as a trophy and GJ got his neck. Wurkin donned a new robe, Amplexus found a new mask, and the rest rotted or went to greed. </p><p>A very few of the levels recently gained, since we all know my memory... this is what was listed in the motd yesterday! <br />Grats Bishup on 63!<br />Grats Kynan on 59!<br />Grats Calidan on 58!<br />Grats Kulvard on 55!</p><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Jun 27, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jun 19, 2004 :: um.. I got a new job </div><p>So, well, I feel a bit more justified in the slacking department! </p><p>Amplexus got his Spear of Fate finally! Well, it was a while ago, but see above for slacker disclaimer. To add to that being a bum status I've earned, I don't have a picture of the frogger. I think that was Arglar's job. /nods</p><p>Dain was kind enough to give Kasserole his head, so she could don her shiny new Belt of Dwarf Slaying! Vorne took that shielding hammer from him. </p><p>Druentia got her 8th shawl of coldain goodness done late at night! Grats to her and her pesky husband who pushed her and didn't even end up stuffed in an oven somewhere. </p><p>Bunches of the guild have been doing the trials in GoD, and some of us are flagged for Kod'Taz now, with others right behind as well. Spells and loots dropped plenty, with much rejoicing. </p><p>Some of the loot gotten recently-ish are shiny wand for Corpseil... err Corseil, new weapon for Reidemuffins, new hat for Nibsim, new book for Meals on Wheels, some swords and shields and jewelry rotted, some were saved from rot. </p><p>Lots of people made lots of levels.. sadly, the only ones currently in the motd are..<br />Lyllian on 65 and Lady Protector!<br />Skynard on 63!<br />Bishup on 62 and no title aside from smith bitch!<br />Reili on 61!<br />Treeleaf on 60 and Warder!<br />Calidan the Paladin on 58!<br />Kilaal on 55!</p><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages:  1 <a href='news.asp?page=2'>2</a> <a href='news.asp?page=3'>3</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=15'>15</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=2'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
			<td class="panel-cell"><!-- Right Panel Cell -->
				<div class="headlines">
<a href=news.asp?newsid=620><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/manaetic_behemoth.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Mar 26</b></a> - Manetic Behemoth and Cap!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=612><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/althumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 29</b></a> - Flawless Victory!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=611><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/adthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 28</b></a> - Aerin'Dar, dragon o' pally loot!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=605><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/grummthumb.gif border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 1</b></a> - I'm bigger than you.. I'm higher on the food chain!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=602><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/littleterry.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Jan 24</b></a> - Terris Thule Naptime!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=575><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/dainthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 22</b></a> - Dain Frostreaver's Feet!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=563><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/yelinak.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 8</b></a> - Lord Yelinak!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=562><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 7</b></a> - Visit to Sleeper's Tomb<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=560><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/tormaxthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 5</b></a> - The King is Dead!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=547><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/vpthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 26</b></a> - Veeshan's Peak cleared!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=543><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/narandithumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 21</b></a> - Mahrsan gets his 10th Ring, and we get to have a war!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=542><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/lendthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 18</b></a> - Keep this, beotch! And Sont too..<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=524><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/zlandthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 3</b></a> - Zland and Kland go down... naughty..<p>
